#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:579
msgid ""
"The **Ethernet edition** of the Vision Shield adds an RJ45 jack with "
"magnetics wired to the STM32H747's 10/100 Ethernet MAC over RMII. Plug in an"
" Ethernet cable and the PHY appears as a ``LAN`` interface; DHCP runs "
